  "description": "Bring warmth and handcrafted charm to your designs with this Rustic Woven Wood Digital Paper Bundle. This premium collection features beautifully interlaced wooden strips in rich shades of teal, turquoise, oak, walnut, cedar, amber, and natural wood tones. Inspired by traditional basket weaving and artisan woodworking, these seamless digital papers create a realistic woven wood texture perfect for rustic, farmhouse, boho, and nature-inspired projects.\nPerfect for scrapbooking, junk journals, wrapping paper, invitations, stationery, fabric printing, sublimation, home décor, wallpaper, POD products, and DIY crafts, these high-resolution seamless backgrounds add authentic handcrafted character to every creation.\nYou Will Receive\n➤ 6 Individual JPG Files\n➤ 12″ × 12″ Inches\n➤ 300 DPI High Resolution\n➤ Seamless Repeat Patterns\n➤ Instant Digital Download\nFeatures\n➤ Realistic woven wood textures\n➤ Rustic teal, turquoise, oak, walnut, cedar, and natural wood color palette\n➤ Seamless repeating digital papers\n➤ Handcrafted basket weave appearance\n➤ Perfect for scrapbooking, wrapping paper, fabric, stationery, planners, invitations, wallpaper, sublimation, POD products, and DIY crafts\n➤ High-resolution 300 DPI quality\n➤ Instant digital download",
